        "Emt12",
        "layer_ビビ神c_右",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "アークデーモン娘がご主人さまを狙って……？\nということはあの手紙、やはり悪戯ではなかったようですね。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "ビビ神",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "4f750397e6dfefa4387401e04acdeb3c8e9755315b133941a0de843621052493",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "それだけじゃねぇ、天使も狙ってるみたいだぜ。\n「四獣神の力を人間が使うのは許せねー」とか言ってるらしいぞ。",
      "jp_sha256": "ff17d6fcbc4044c436d8bf5cb81a7b96b0014072026ff620dbc309addee06872",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그뿐만 아냐, 천사도 노리는 것 같더라.\n\"사수신의 힘을 인간이 쓰는 건 용납할 수 없다\"라고 한다던데.",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 29,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "b4519ef5f3265ad696458b0eb970b9cd5d7629e43c5ec147646aa7370f594025:000000_-8770156106755742527:g0:r28",
      "row_index_0based": 28,
      "serialized_row_index": 28,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "メド",
        "Emt7_Ama",
        "layer_左中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "それだけじゃねぇ、天使も狙ってるみたいだぜ。\n「四獣神の力を人間が使うのは許せねー」とか言ってるらしいぞ。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "メド",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "6991dc8ccba6473871ad9f5b88638532395f1869c3d7132511bcc0c4fefecf6b",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "なるほど――。\n四獣神が力を合わせることはめったにありませんから。\n膨大なエネルギーを天使と悪魔に感知されてしまったのですね。",
      "jp_sha256": "f304c60aac363fca9b7f3395480372a84bd8cdba50334d646845f38c945a32f1",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그렇군요――.\n사수신이 힘을 합치는 일은 드무니까요.\n막대한 에너지를 천사와 악마가 감지한 것이군요.",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 30,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "b4519ef5f3265ad696458b0eb970b9cd5d7629e43c5ec147646aa7370f594025:000000_-8770156106755742527:g0:r29",
      "row_index_0based": 29,
      "serialized_row_index": 29,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ビビ神",
        "Emt12",
        "layer_ビビ神c_右",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "なるほど――。\n四獣神が力を合わせることはめったにありませんから。\n膨大なエネルギーを天使と悪魔に感知されてしまったのですね。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "ビビ神",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "e7aebe8f2b900259468fb0f083b26b94e34288fa3c051ecaa4806a2cca834285",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 10,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "いやらしい症候群を治してもらった時の、あの力ですか。\nしかし、あの方法以外どうしようも――。",
      "jp_sha256": "dc8357b38203db21bfd4172bd248ac95666058ac83fa641fdce641fb686c21c8",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "야릇한 증후군을 치료받을 때의 그 힘인가요.\n하지만 그 방법 말고는 어쩔 도리가――.",
      "message_index_0based": 10,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 31,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
